    "title": "Man charged with manslaughter in death of toddler asks for bail amendment - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Susan Farley ,\n11 hours ago ROCKLAND -- A man charged with manslaughter in the death of a toddler was in court this morning to ask that his bail be amended. Aziayh Scott went on trial for his alleged involvement in the death of 22-month-old Quayshawn Wilson in November. He was found unresponsive in a Walmart... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
